18	// the two calls sit in one small setup block in this app (a `.map` over the
19	// signal list), and a file that acquired a second, unrelated `resume()` above the
20	// setup would be flagged — a false positive that is cheap to see and cheaper than
21	// missing the real ordering bug, which is invisible at runtime until the one
22	// signal that lands in the gap.
